" fill="#ffffff">User action</text><text x="842" y="411" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">Generation-pinned frame/DIP</text><text x="842" y="432" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">actions</text><text x="842" y="476" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#8b5c14">Alternate path</text><text x="842" y="504" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">Protected owner root: refuse</text><text x="842" y="525" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">input</text><path d="M 1192 335 h 22 l -7 -6 m 7 6 l -7 6" fill="none" stroke="#234b70" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="1221" y="115" width="365" height="485" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#cfdae5"/><text x="1239" y="151" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#20354a">4. Disconnect</text><text x="1239" y="181" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#20354a">SCR07</text><rect x="1239" y="206" width="329" height="170" rx="12" fill="#e8f0f7" stroke="#cfdae5"/><rect x="1251" y="220" width="305" height="24" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#cfdae5"/><text x="1262" y="237" font-size="12" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">SCR07 / selected screen state</text><rect x="1251" y="260" width="305" height="46" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#cfdae5"/><rect x="1251" y="318" width="180" height="35" rx="12" fill="#234b70" stroke="#cfdae5"/><text x="1263" y="341" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#ffffff">User action</text><text x="1239" y="411" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">Close socket, release pressed</text><text x="1239" y="432" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">keys</text><text x="1239" y="476" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#8b5c14">Alternate path</text><text x="1239" y="504" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#20354a">Never retry an uncertain click</text><rect x="30" y="633" width="1544" height="105" rx="12" fill="#fff6e8" stroke="#cfdae5"/><text x="48" y="663" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#20354a">Boundary / branch</text><text x="48" y="690" fo